Upstream projects and acknowledgements
======================================

joakimtoe/KlipperLCD
https://github.com/joakimtoe/KlipperLCD

KlipperLCD was originally developed by Joakimtoe for the Elegoo
Neptune 3 Pro touchscreen and forms the principal upstream origin
of the KlipperLCD display-service concept and code lineage used by
this project.

KlipperLCD is distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.


CiareCw455/Tortillery
https://github.com/CiareCw455/Tortillery

Tortillery adapted KlipperLCD and custom touchscreen firmware for
the Artillery Sidewinder X4 Pro / X4 Plus family and explicitly
credits Joakimtoe/KlipperLCD as the origin of its display support.

This project incorporates and further develops concepts and
Artillery-specific work originating from the Tortillery community.


mechano/ArtilleryX4PlusScreenService
https://github.com/mechano/ArtilleryX4PlusScreenService

This project provided a standalone distribution of the Artillery
X4 KlipperLCD service derived from the Tortillery firmware project
and helped establish the standalone Artillery X4 service lineage.


Artillery-KlipperLCD
https://github.com/HerrHaseGermany/Artillery-KlipperLCD

This repository further adapts and extends the above work.

Major additions and modifications include:

- Standalone repository layout
- Integrated Artillery touchscreen service
- Bundled TFT firmware
- Automated TJC/Nextion-compatible firmware flashing
- SHA-256 based TFT firmware version tracking
- Automatic first-install TFT deployment
- Moonraker and Mainsail Update Manager integration
- systemd service integration
- Reproducible installer for compatible BTT Manta M5P / CB2 systems
- Additional maintenance, UI, protocol, and integration work

